---
title: Aster — Request Execution Sequence
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#edf3fd'
    primaryTextColor: '#19263e'
    primaryBorderColor: '#466ab2'
    actorBkg: '#edf3fd'
    actorBorder: '#466ab2'
    actorTextColor: '#19263e'
    signalColor: '#234c86'
    noteBkgColor: '#f2eeff'
    noteBorderColor: '#b9a6de'
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    messageMargin: 30
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User & app
    participant H as Deep Agent Harness
    participant M as Memory & context
    participant B as Tools & browser
    participant S as Dining / Travel subagents
    participant C as Company MCP
    participant T as Temporal

    rect rgb(237,243,253)
    U->>H: Request + constraints
    Note over H: Validate identity & policy
    H->>M: Load scoped context
    M-->>H: Messages, preferences & checkpoint
    Note over H: Resolve intent · plan next step
    end

    opt Specialist domain task
      H->>S: Delegate scoped work
      S->>C: Search / availability
      C-->>S: Structured results
      S-->>H: Results + evidence
    end
    opt Application tool
      H->>B: Research, files or image generation
      B-->>H: Evidence / artifact
    end
    opt Browser task
      H->>B: Browser goal + confirmed details
      Note over B: Observe → act → verify
      opt Consequential action
        B->>H: Approval request
        H->>U: Ask approval
        U->>H: Approve / reject
        H->>B: Proceed only if approved
      end
      B-->>H: Verified outcome / explicit blocker
    end

    rect rgb(237,243,253)
    Note over H: Check evidence · reconcile results
    H-->>U: Stream verified output as ready
    Note over U,H: Trip example: flights → hotels → days
    H->>M: Save checkpoint + eligible memory
    Note over M: Assumptions stay in chat-scoped draft
    end

    opt Authorized durable work — availability watches / recurring monitors
      H->>T: Start workflow / schedule
      T->>S: Run or retry scoped activity
      S->>C: Watch / recheck
      C-->>S: Signed change callback
      S-->>T: Persist inbox → signal workflow
      T-->>H: Resume / deliver durable result
      H-->>U: Notify actionable change
    end
    Note over H,T: Browser actions are not automatically replayed by Temporal
